msgid "Choose the StarCraft folder itself, the one that holds StarCraft Launcher.exe and the x86_64 and Data folders, for example C:\\Program Files (x86)\\StarCraft."
msgstr "請選擇 StarCraft 資料夾本身，也就是放有 StarCraft Launcher.exe 以及 x86_64 和 Data 資料夾的那一個，例如 C:\\Program Files (x86)\\StarCraft。"

#: src117/port/data/port_install_window.cpp:91
