msgid "Distance"
msgstr "距離"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_mutators.cpp:1790
msgid "How far a base must be from every start, in a straight line, to turn rich: in tiles, or a share of the map’s size, its width and height averaged. For Outside a radius."
