msgstr "{0} 個起始位置 · {1} × {2} 格 · {3}"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1409
msgid "Plays under Hyperion rules: past the original’s 8 players."
msgstr "採用 Hyperion 規則：超出原版的 8 位玩家。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1410
msgid "Plays under Hyperion rules: past the original’s 256 tiles."
msgstr "採用 Hyperion 規則：超出原版的 256 格。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1413
msgid "Classic or Hyperion rules."
msgstr "經典或 Hyperion 規則。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1432
msgid "{0} map, counting its folders"
msgid_plural "{0} maps, counting its folders"
msgstr[0] "{0} 張地圖，含子資料夾"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1447
msgid "Double-click or Enter opens it."
msgstr "連按兩下或按 Enter 開啟。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1458
msgid "CHOOSE A MAP"
msgstr "選擇地圖"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1490
msgid "Maps for Brood War"
msgstr "Brood War 的地圖"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1490
msgid "Maps for StarCraft"
msgstr "StarCraft 的地圖"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1525
#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1602
msgid "Open Folder"
msgstr "開啟資料夾"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1525
msgid "Choose Map"
msgstr "選擇地圖"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1538
msgid "The set-up waits: choose {0} again to keep it."
msgstr "目前的設定會暫時保留：再選擇一次 {0} 就會沿用。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1540
msgid "Slots, races and options come next."
msgstr "接下來是欄位、種族與選項。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1741
msgid "{0}: player {1}’s colour. Picking it swaps the two."
msgstr "{0}：玩家 {1} 的顏色。選它會讓兩者互換。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1743
msgid "{0}: reads as player {1}’s colour {2}. Picking it swaps the two."
msgstr "{0}：看起來與玩家 {1} 的顏色 {2} 相同。選它會讓兩者互換。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1746
msgid "{0}: hard to tell from player {1}’s colour {2}."
msgstr "{0}：與玩家 {1} 的顏色 {2} 難以分辨。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1779
msgid "Now its own colour, {0}"
msgstr "現在是它自己的顏色，{0}"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1780
msgid "Now {0}"
msgstr "現在是 {0}"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1787
msgid "A number: that player’s colour. Picking it swaps the two."
msgstr "數字：該玩家的顏色。選它會讓兩者互換。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1790
msgid "Orange rim: hard to tell from a player’s colour."
msgstr "橘色外框：與某位玩家的顏色難以分辨。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1827
msgid "The units"
msgstr "單位"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1834
msgid "The minimap"
msgstr "小地圖"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1839
msgid "Nobody else to compare with."
msgstr "沒有其他人可以比較。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1840
msgid "Clear of every other player, on the minimap and in the units."
msgstr "在小地圖上與單位上都與其他玩家分得清楚。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1845
msgid "Reads as player {0}’s colour {1}. Choose another, or give player {0} a new colour first."
msgstr "看起來與玩家 {0} 的顏色 {1} 相同。請換一個，或先為玩家 {0} 指定新的顏色。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1848
msgid "Close to player {0}’s colour {1}. Allowed, and marked on both."
msgstr "與玩家 {0} 的顏色 {1} 相近。允許使用，兩邊都會標示。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1859
msgid "Use This Colour"
msgstr "使用這個顏色"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1919
msgid "Close colours"
msgstr "相近的顏色"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1920
msgid "Hard to tell from player {0}’s colour {1}. Pick another, or press Distinct Colours to separate every player’s."
msgstr "與玩家 {0} 的顏色 {1} 難以分辨。請換一個，或按「區分顏色」讓每位玩家的顏色分開。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1946
msgid "Colour for player {0}"
msgstr "玩家 {0} 的顏色"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1947
msgid "The game’s colours"
msgstr "遊戲的顏色"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1947
msgid "Any colour"
msgstr "任何顏色"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1971
msgid "Observer 1"
msgstr "觀戰者 1"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1972
msgid "An observer has no seat: they watch every seat play, the whole map shown."
msgstr "觀戰者沒有席位：他們觀看所有席位進行遊戲，並看得見整張地圖。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1991
msgid "Empty"
msgstr "空位"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1994
#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2115
#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2119
#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2198
#: src117/port/front/port_frontkit.cpp:376
msgid "Use Map Settings"
msgstr "使用地圖設定"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1995
#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2116
msgid "The map seats the players and runs the game, and expects you in your seat. Watching a game of computers is for melee games."
msgstr "由地圖安排玩家並控制遊戲進行，而且預期你要坐在自己的席位上。觀看電腦對戰只適用於一般對戰。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1998
msgid "Observer"
msgstr "觀戰者"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:1999
msgid "Watch instead of playing: your seat becomes a computer, and you watch every seat play with the whole map shown, the replay’s controls and speeds up to 16 times Fastest."
msgstr "改為觀戰而不親自進行：你的席位會變成電腦，而你會看著所有席位進行遊戲，看得見整張地圖，並可使用戰鬥錄影的控制與最高 16 倍「最快」的速度。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2012
msgid "The whole map shown, the replay’s controls, up to 16 times Fastest"
msgstr "看得見整張地圖，可使用戰鬥錄影的控制，最高 16 倍「最快」"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2020
msgid "EMPTY"
msgstr "空位"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2022
msgid "watching is for melee games"
msgstr "觀戰只適用於一般對戰"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2023
msgid "choose You to watch a game of computers"
msgstr "選擇「你」才能觀看電腦對戰"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2045
msgid "Starts are drawn at random in a melee game, so a slot is not a place on the map. Choose Start positions: By slot to give each player a start."
msgstr "一般對戰的起始位置是隨機抽出的，因此欄位並不對應地圖上的位置。選擇「起始位置：依欄位」才能為每位玩家指定起點。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2078
msgid "You, the host"
msgstr "你，主持者"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2078
msgid "The host"
msgstr "主持者"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2085
msgid "Closed"
msgstr "關閉"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2105
#: src117/port/lan/port_front_lan.cpp:1835
msgid "{0} (you)"
msgstr "{0}（你）"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2119
msgid "The map seats the players and runs the game."
msgstr "由地圖安排玩家並控制遊戲進行。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2121
msgid "Your seat"
msgstr "你的席位"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2122
msgid "Play it yourself, or make it a computer and watch: every seat a computer, the whole map shown, with the replay’s controls and speeds up to 16 times Fastest."
msgstr "可以自己進行，也可以改成電腦來觀戰：所有席位都是電腦，看得見整張地圖，並可使用戰鬥錄影的控制與最高 16 倍「最快」的速度。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2125
msgid "The seat"
msgstr "席位"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2126
msgid "Open: the next person in the room to join takes it. A person seated here goes back to the room when the seat is made a computer, closed or open. The host may give up their own seat to run the room, and take any seat that is not a person's again."
msgstr "「開放」：房間中下一個加入的人會坐進來。坐在這裡的人在席位被改成電腦、關閉或開放時會回到房間。主持者可以放棄自己的席位來管理房間，之後也能再坐進任何沒有人的席位。"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2145
msgid "OPEN"
msgstr "開放"

#: src117/port/front/port_front_skirmish.cpp:2145
