msgid "The most supply each player can hold. Classic: 200."
msgstr "每位玩家可擁有的最大補給。經典版：200。"

#: src117/port/gameplay/port_mutators.cpp:72
msgid "The workers each player begins with, beside the town hall. Classic: 4."
msgstr "每位玩家開場在主基地旁的工人數。經典版：4。"

#: src117/port/gameplay/port_mutators.cpp:73
msgid "More supply from each depot, pylon, overlord and town hall. Classic: none, a depot’s 8."
msgstr "每個補給站、水晶塔、王蟲與主基地提供更多補給。經典版：不加成，補給站為 8。"

#: src117/port/gameplay/port_mutators.cpp:74
msgid "Explored: every player knows the map’s land from the start, under the fog. None: every player sees the whole map all game. Classic: the fog of war."
msgstr "「已探索」：每位玩家一開始就知道地圖的地形，但仍在迷霧之下。「無」：每位玩家全場都看得見整張地圖。經典版：戰爭迷霧。"

#: src117/port/gameplay/port_mutators.cpp:76
msgid "How long buildings, units, research and upgrades take to make: ×0.5 takes half as long. Classic: ×1."
msgstr "建築、單位、研發與升級所需的時間：×0.5 表示只要一半。經典版：×1。"

#: src117/port/gameplay/port_mutators.cpp:78
msgid "Researched: every upgrade at its top level and every ability researched from the start. No upgrades: none can be researched. No research: neither upgrades nor the abilities that need research. Classic: all to research."
msgstr "「已研發」：開場所有升級都已達最高等級，所有技能都已研發完成。「無升級」：無法研發升級。「無研發」：升級與需要研發的技能都無法研發。經典版：全部需要研發。"

#: src117/port/gameplay/port_mutators.cpp:81
msgid "Bases away from every start may turn rich: gold mineral fields and violet geysers that give 11 minerals and 16 gas a trip, and run dry sooner. Never a start's main or natural; bases that mirror each other turn rich together. Every base: all of them. Classic: none."
msgstr "遠離所有起點的基地可能變成富礦：金色晶礦場與紫羅蘭色瓦斯湧源，每趟給 11 晶礦與 16 瓦斯，但也更快枯竭。永遠不會是起點的主礦或天然分礦；互為鏡像的基地會一起變成富礦。「每個基地」：全部都變。經典版：一個也沒有。"

